# Moxa ioThinx 45MR-3810.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Moxa ioThinx 45MR-3810 — 8-channel AI (voltage: ±10V / 0-10V)
# | 
# | Source: ioThinx 4510 Series User's Manual V2.1, August 2019, Appendix A
# | Protocol: Modbus/TCP via ioThinx 4510 adapter, port 502
# | 
# | Identical register map to 45MR-3800; differs in supported input ranges (voltage vs current).
# | IMPORTANT: Addresses are MODULE-RELATIVE. Actual PDU address = slot_base + relative_address.
# | Slot base depends on which slot this module occupies in the ioThinx 4510 chassis.
# | 
# | FC01 (coil R/W): aiResetMinValue ch0-7 (8 BOOL, W=1 to reset min tracking),
# | aiResetMaxValue ch0-7 (8 BOOL, W=1 to reset max tracking)
# | FC03 (holding R/W): see [[registers]] below
# | FC04 (input R): aiValueRaw ch0-7 (8 WORD, raw ADC counts),
# | aiValueRawMin ch0-7 (8 WORD), aiValueRawMax ch0-7 (8 WORD),
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Moxa
@model=ioThinx 45MR-3810
@description=8-AI voltage-input (±10V/0-10V) ioThinx 45MR slot module. Register map identical to 45MR-3800; differs in supported input ranges. Addresses are module-relative; actual PDU address = slot_base + relative_address. FC01: aiResetMinValue ch0-7 (W=1 to reset), aiResetMaxValue ch0-7 (W=1 to reset). FC03: aiResetMinValueAll (rel 0), aiResetMaxValueAll (rel 1). FC04: aiValueRaw ch0-7 (8 WORD), aiValueRawMin ch0-7, aiValueRawMax ch0-7, aiValueScaled ch0-7 (f32 2-regs/ch = 16 regs), aiValueScaledMin (16 regs), aiValueScaledMax (16 regs), aiStatus ch0-7 (0=normal 1=burnout 2=over-range 3=under-range), aiBurnoutValueScaled ch0-7 (f32, 16 regs), aiMode ch0-7 (0=disable 1=0-10V 2=0-20mA 3=4-20mA+burnout 4=4-20mA 5=±10V).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/moxa-iothinx-45mr-3810.toml; Source: ioThinx 4510 Series User's Manual V2.1, August 2019, Appendix A. Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

